---
title: Variables round
---

Test pages of the variables round, in two modes: passthrough (each
`<%= vars.name %>` written as a Markdoc variable, with the book's values
as they are), and native (the values prepared for Markdoc, links with a
variable target written with a tag, and a check for names that are not
defined). The raw mode holds one page exactly as the book writes it.
